WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.888
Welcome to Orbit. Plans and possibilities. Our focus is Plans, arrangements and predictions.

2
00:00:08.888 --> 00:00:17.371
Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now.

3
00:00:17.371 --> 00:00:21.610
We are visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked.

4
00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.649
I think the weather will be fine tomorrow.

5
00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:29.093
Look at those clouds. It is going to rain.

6
00:00:29.093 --> 00:00:38.491
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
